OL,3,ATexas ICE shooting leaves Venezuelan
OL,4,ADoorDash driver with bullet in his
OL,5,Aback, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FProtesters gathered in Austin on Sunday
OL,8,Fafter a US Immigration and Customs
OL,9,FEnforcement (ICE) agent shot and
OL,10,Fwounded a man in the Texas capital.
OL,12,FWilber Rafael Garces Perez, a
OL,13,F28-year-old Venezuelan DoorDash
OL,14,Fdelivery driver, was shot in the torso
OL,15,Fand later transferred from hospital to
OL,16,Fa detention centre with a bullet still
OL,17,Fin his back, his lawyer told US media.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
