OL,3,ATexas ICE shooting leaves Venezuelan
OL,4,ADoorDash driver with bullet in his
OL,5,Aback, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,8,F(DHS) said in a statement to the BBC it
OL,9,Fwas investigating the shooting of a man
OL,10,Fin Austin who had entered the country
OL,11,Fillegally.
OL,13,FIt is unclear what led to the shooting
OL,14,Fwith the local mayor and police
OL,15,Fdemanding an investigation. It comes
OL,16,Fmonths after a man in Houston was shot
OL,17,Fdead by an ICE officer.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
